title: "eeemcal-pi0-calibration: EEEMCal pi0 calibration software"
version: 0.1.0
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - family-names: "Muñoz Camacho"
    given-names: "Carlos"
abstract: >-
  Candidate per-crystal relative gain determination for the ePIC backward
  electromagnetic calorimeter using reconstructed two-photon showers,
  a constrained Jones-style calibration and independent held-out validation.
keywords:
